[[2504,960,"There was a general lack of awareness and understanding of the drugs issues in the prison by prison officers","prison officers' lack of awareness of drug issues",""],[2505,960,"There is a lack of multi‐disciplinary approach to drug issues within the prison","lack of multi-disciplinary drug issue discussion",""],[2506,960,"General medicine administration does not involve a check of the mouth so prisoners can easily conceal tablets to sell later","medicine administration lacks mouth check",""],[2507,960,"Cell searches only take place for a certain number of cells each month on a random basis as prescribed by NOMS, or for targeted cells when there is sufficient intelligence","insufficient cell search coverage",""],[2508,960,"Prisoners on B wing are not viewed or monitored at all overnight unless they are on an ACCT","lack of overnight monitoring of B wing prisoners",""],[2509,960,"The prison deploy a security officer to B wing at night (172 prisoners).This person is unable to interact with prisoners and is only there to answer call bells","inadequate night security officer deployment",""]]